**Overview of findings:**

**CHK-0071 through CHK-0077 (Fiat-Shamir completeness checks):** All classified as **FALSE_POSITIVE**. The C-KZG library (`c-kzg-4844 v2.1.1`) correctly implements the EIP-7594 Fiat-Shamir challenge via `compute_r_powers_for_verify_cell_kzg_proof_batch` in `/home/gohan/go/pkg/mod/github.com/ethereum/c-kzg-4844/v2@v2.1.1/src/eip7594/eip7594.c`. The SHA-256 preimage binds all seven required elements: domain separator `"RCKZGCBATCH__V1_"`, `num_commitments`, `num_cells`, deduplicated commitment bytes, `commitment_indices`, `cell_indices`, cell data, and proofs. The Go wrapper at `/home/gohan/runners/security-agent-1/_work/security-agent/security-agent/target_workspace/beacon-chain/blockchain/kzg/kzg.go:98-106` correctly delegates to the library without dropping any parameters.

